# Every text file is LF in the repository and in every checkout, Windows
# included. Several tests read repository files at run time or through
# `include_str!` (tests/integration_test.rs, src/prelude.rs, the
# description.yml corpus), and the book's doctest harness includes each page
# verbatim, so a CRLF checkout would test different bytes than CI's Linux jobs.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never converted, never diffed as text. Fuzz seeds, text or not,
# must reach the fuzzer byte for byte (one exercises an escaped newline).
*.png binary
*.bin binary
fuzz/seeds/** binary
